# hookprobe-api read-API base URL (ADR 0001), read at BUILD time (Vite/Astro inlines
# `PUBLIC_*` vars into the static bundle — there is no server-side runtime to read this from).
#
# - Local dev (Astro dev server on :4321, hookprobe-api on its documented default :8420):
#     leave unset — store/live.ts defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8420.
# - On-device / production, once the UI's static assets are served from the SAME origin as
#   hookprobe-api (or a reverse proxy fronts both): set to '' (same-origin, no CORS needed).
#
# PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8420

# hookprobe-planner BYO-LLM planner base URL (ADR 0025), same build-time-inlined convention.
# A SEPARATE service/port from hookprobe-api above — see crates/hookprobe-planner/src/main.rs's
# module doc for why the read-only read-API and this narrow, additive write surface are split.
#
# - Local dev: leave unset — store/plannerApi.ts defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8421.
# - On-device / production, same-origin: set to ''.
#
# PUBLIC_PLANNER_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8421
